<li><a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/site-move-with-url-changes?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Google for Developers</a></li>
<li><a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/monitor-debug/google-analytics-search-console?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Google for Developers</a></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section class="side-card"><h2>Bacaan terkait</h2><a class="back-link" href="../llms-txt-geo-ai-search-2026/">llms.txt untuk GEO dan AI Search</a><a class="back-link" href="../creative-fatigue-meta-ads-cara-audit/">Creative Fatigue Meta Ads</a></section>
</aside></div></main>
<footer class="article-footer"><div class="article-shell"><span>© 2026 Nordy Sukmana</span><a href="../artikel/">Lihat semua artikel</a></div></footer>
<script is:inline src="/assets/analytics-loader.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
